I2C Read Sequence

-- Reading from a peripheral address
START
Device address + Read
Receive data
NACK final byte
STOP

-- Reading from a peripheral address + register address
START
+ Device address + Write
+ Register address
+ Repeated START
Device address + Read
Receive data
    1 byte
    2 byte
    n byte
NACK final byte
STOP

